ase when Ahaan and Karma meet his ex-girlfriend. Meanwhile, his friend Krish makes an entry.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tNi6cR1YsA9c0g19emd0TSKLNih.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9LYXJtbWEtQ2FsbGluZy0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAyNC0tJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Andhere Raaz","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Next, Karma trains her sights on Indrani's trusted psychic healer, who left a deep wound in her as a child. Krish becomes a stumbling block to Ahaan and Karma's relationship.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/YvHnte9YWYC0DXSeOM0j1hgxph.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9LYXJtbWEtQ2FsbGluZy0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAyNC0tJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Hisaab Barabar","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ahaan and Karma finally confront each other. Kaushal panics when Dolly threatens him. Moreover, she finds an interesting photograph in her apartment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/88RukPa9UZl7XDVvc9BcNMapBay.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9LYXJtbWEtQ2FsbGluZy0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAyNC0tJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Dil Aur Dimaag","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kaushal is aghast to watch Dolly's video. Krish tells Ahaan about his parent's equation. Deeply shaken, Ahaan joins Bombil Cafe where Vedant becomes his taskmaster.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8F6nWFEWzCofbwd48U3nwEN0Fkh.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNC9LYXJtbWEtQ2FsbGluZy0lMjhUVi1TZXJpZXMtMjAyNC0tJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Vaada","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-01-26T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sameer uncovers a darker secret about Karma's past. While she is living the high life in Alibaug with Ahaan, unbeknownst to her, Ambika Mehra's revenge plan may be at risk.","thumbn